{"account":"me@diegonmarcos.com","filters":{"_axis_doc":"Each view declares its axis and whether it is volatile. A volatile view depends on wall-clock time or read state and must be re-evaluated every poll; a static view is a property of the message itself (size, attachments) and is computed once. The size axis is a PARTITION: its buckets are half-open [lo,hi) and must tile the whole range, so every message lands in exactly one. That invariant is what lets the sorter use size-view membership as the sentinel for 'static views already computed' -- guarded by 9_others/test/test_mail_filter_views_partition.sh.","_doc":"Dynamic cross-cutting filter views maintained by jmap-sorter each poll over emails in the numeric 1*-9* folders. Multi-mailbox membership only (no copies, no $seen changes); add+remove each poll so time/read windows stay current.","partition_axis":"size","section_headers":["A0 _ SIZE","B0 _ TIME","C0 _ STATE","D0 _ ATTACH","E0 _ PRIORITY"],"source_folder_regex":"^[0-9]","views":[{"axis":"size","folder":"Aa    📏 Large (≥10MB)","predicate":{"bytes":10485760,"type":"size_min"},"volatile":false},{"axis":"size","folder":"Ab    📏 Medium (1–10MB)","predicate":{"max":10485760,"min":1048576,"type":"size_range"},"volatile":false},{"axis":"size","folder":"Ac    📏 Small (<1MB)","predicate":{"bytes":1048576,"type":"size_max"},"volatile":false},{"axis":"time","folder":"Ba    ⏱️ Last 24h","predicate":{"hours":24,"type":"newer_than_hours"},"volatile":true},{"axis":"time","folder":"Bc    ⏱️ Last 7 days","predicate":{"hours":168,"type":"newer_than_hours"},"volatile":true},{"axis":"time","folder":"Bd    ⏱️ Older than 7 days","predicate":{"hours":168,"type":"older_than_hours"},"volatile":true},{"axis":"state","folder":"Ca    📩 Unread","predicate":{"type":"unread"},"volatile":true},{"axis":"state","folder":"Cb    📩 Read","predicate":{"type":"read"},"volatile":true},{"axis":"attach","folder":"Da    📎 With attachments","predicate":{"type":"has_attachment"},"volatile":false},{"a